    "value": "Validation/Integrity"
   }
  ],
  "customfield_10037": null,
  "customfield_10041": [],
  "customfield_10042": null,
  "customfield_10043": null,
  "customfield_10044": null,
  "customfield_10045": null,
  "customfield_10047": null,
  "customfield_10048": null,
  "customfield_10049": null,
  "customfield_10050": null,
  "customfield_10051": null,
  "customfield_10052": null,
  "customfield_10053": null,
  "customfield_10054": null,
  "customfield_10087": null,
  "customfield_10121": null,
  "customfield_10154": null,
  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It would be useful for",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Data object datastreams to be able to specify charset in the MIMEType, so their contents can properly be interpreted",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "CModels to only specify the media-type in the MIMEType; ie charset can vary per data object",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Current ECM validation of this is an exact match, so this is not possible.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Email thread on this issue: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/message.php?msg_id=28567702"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/message.php?msg_id=28567702",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Suggest we should when validating:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "parse the MIMEType fields, based on the format:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "type/subtype; name1=value1; name2=value2",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          }
         ],
         "type": "bulletList"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Validate as follows:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "type/subtype should be matched exactly (could be future enhancements to define a hierarchy of mimetypes for validation) (or maybe we allow wildcards, eg text/* or */xml ?)",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "If CModel specifies a param eg name1 then (1) object datastream must specify the param with the same value",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "Datastream is allowed to specify addtional params that are not in the CModel specification (but if datastream specifies a param name and the same param name is in the CModel specification then there must be an exact match)",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "could be future enhancements to this, eg specifying lists of acceptable param values - could even do this now with a specification such as \"text/xml; charset=utf-8|utf-16\"",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "could potentially allow wildcard specification of parameter values, which would be interpreted as such - the datastream ",
               "type": "text"
              },
              {
               "marks": [
                {
                 "type": "strong"
                }
               ],
               "text": "must",
               "type": "text"
              },
              {
               "text": " have the parameter, but can have any value, eg \"text/xml; charset=*\"",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          }
         ],
         "type": "bulletList"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Minimal requirement from my perspective is:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "CModel specifies mimetype:  \"text/xml\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Datastream specifies mimetype \"text/xml; charset=utf-8\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "And this is accepted as valid.  But mimetype \"application/xml; charset=utf-8\" is not valid.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A thought... we could just encode the CModel mimetype as a regexp - and that gives all the flexibility we need?  Or is this a bit ugly?  And some extra attribute etc to specify interpretation a regexp?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
